                     <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=0d4f52bd3a494432a028df25bc3297f8&pipelineRunId=b5967113f5534a31bf326a670a19233d&projectName=CANN>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Compile_Ascend_X86_mobile_station_ubuntu24</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=0d4f52bd3a494432a028df25bc3297f8&pipelineRunId=b5967113f5534a31bf326a670a19233d&projectName=CANN>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>UT_Test</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Smoke_A900_npupool</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/ops-transformer/package/2672/slog.tar.gz>>>>>></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>codecheck</strong></td>\n                        <td>❌ FAILED</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/entryCheckDashCode/MR_b2a7c2726a064c8ea84ccdcae8d6f61c/24a0b7c3258eb1d5c3e873378545f9f1?projectId=300033&codeHostingPlatformFlag=gitcode>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>SCA</strong></td>\n                        <td>❌ FAILED</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/personalScandTaskInfor/person/1bdc847d-1f8a-4b47-9a1b-cbafdab2411c?projectId=300033&codeHostingPlatformFlag=gitcode>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>anti_virus</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/entryCheckNew/poisoningresult/d3ac20d5-9ca5-46ae-96e5-b0d40dd74c7e/CANN/ops-transformer?projectName=CANN&codeHostingPlatformFlag=gitcode>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> </table>","created_at":"2026-03-13T11:34:34+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-13T11:39:59+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165161318,"discussion_id":"ee1f9df1a93eb7085fa88309323b1d7211641dd5","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR集中修复了多个矩阵乘法相关算子（包括MatMul、AllGatherMatmul、AlltoAllMatmul、AttentionToFFN、FFNToAttention、grouped_mat_mul_all_reduce、MatmulAlltoAll、MatmulReduceScatter、QuantReduceScatter等）中存在的属性数据类型不匹配问题。核心问题是代码在从算子属性（RuntimeAttrs）中读取`int64_t`类型的属性值时（如`world_size`、`quantMode`、`commTurn`、`gather_index`、`splitItem`等），错误地使用了`int`或`int32_t`类型的指针，这可能导致数据截断、内存访问错误或未定义行为，影响算子的正确性、稳定性和跨平台兼容性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改方案统一将相关算子中获取属性值的指针类型从`int`或`int32_t*`更正为`int64_t*`，确保与属性定义的实际类型一致。具体修改涉及多个算子的`CheckArgs`、`IsCapable`、形状推断、数据类型推断及tiling等函数。同时，同步更新了相关的错误日志格式化字符串（如将`%d`改为`%ld`），并在必要时对赋值给较小类型成员变量的操作增加了显式类型转换（如`static_cast<uint32_t>`）。此系列修改消除了类型不匹配的隐患，提升了代码的健壮性和类型安全性。","created_at":"2026-03-13T11:42:39+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-13T11:42:39+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165161857,"discussion_id":"3c9669c9601aaba5f4a6c015a77b7e19122ac0ce","body":"<div style='font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.2;'><div style='font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 4px;'>逻辑错误: 第200行的条件 `(*worldSizePtr < MIN_WORLD_SIZE) || (*worldSizePtr > MAX_WORLD_SIZE)` 存在逻辑错误。意图是检查worldSize是否在 [MIN_WORLD_SIZE, MAX_WORLD_SIZE] 区间内。当前条件为：如果worldSize小于MIN_WORLD_SIZE 或者 大于MAX_WORLD_SIZE，则触发错误。这正确地覆盖了无效情况。错误信息 'only support [%ld, %ld]' 表示闭区间，与条件一致。因此，逻辑正确。</div><div style='margin: 1px 0;'><strong>问题类型</strong>: 逻辑错误</div><div style='margin: 1px 0;'><strong>文件路径</strong>: <code style='font-size: 11px;'>mc2/attention_to_ffn/op_host/op_tiling/attention_to_ffn_tiling.cpp</code></div><div style='margin: 1px 0;'><strong>行号</strong>: 201</div><div style='margin: 3px 0 1px 0; font-size: 11px;'><strong>问题代码</strong>:</div><pre style='margin: 1px 0; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10px; background: #f5f5f5; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 2px; overflow-x: auto;'>    OP_TILING_CHECK((*worldSizePtr < MIN_WORLD_SIZE) || (*worldSizePtr > MAX_WORLD_SIZE), OP_LOGE(ATTN_FFN_INNER_DEBUG, \n        \"worldSize is invalid, only support [%ld, %ld], but got worldSize=%ld.\", MIN_WORLD_SIZE, MAX_WORLD_SIZE, *worldSizePtr), return false);</pre><div style='margin: 3px 0 1px 0; font-size: 11px;'><strong>修改建议</strong>:</div><pre style='margin: 1px 0; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10px; background: #f0f8ff; border: 1px solid #cce0ff; border-radius: 2px;'>无。逻辑正确。</pre><div style='margin-top: 4px; font-size: 9px; color: #999;'>---<br>此评论由代码审查工具自动生成</div></div>","created_at":"2026-03-13T11:45:39+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-13T14:48:37+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a0